    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、まだ次の予定まで時間があるし\r\nどこかで暇をつぶすか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あっ、それじゃ……\r\nうち、そこのショッピングモールに行きたか～。よか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいぞ。なにか買いたいものでもあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほら、長崎フェアいうのをやっとるけん\r\nばり気になるとよ～",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、恋鐘の故郷だしな……って、走ると危ないぞー",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0118",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
