  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うわ～、懐かしか～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ……長崎の特産品っていろいろあるんだな\r\nおすすめはなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "もちろん、全部たい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ちゃんぽんは具沢山で栄養満点\r\nおなかもいっぱいになるし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "五島うどんは麺にコシがあって、ダシの風味も最高たい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "佐世保バーガーはお店のこだわりが詰まっとるけん\r\nばり美味しか～",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（話を聞いてたら、全部食べたくなってきたぞ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ！　せっかくだし、事務所のみんなに\r\nお土産を買っていこう……俺も食べたいし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、選んでくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "まかせとって～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んー、全部買っていきとうばってん\r\nそれは無理やし……どれがよかかね～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020100"
  },
  {
