  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "いやー、結局ほとんど買うてしもうたね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれも魅力的だったからな、仕方ないさ\r\n長崎って美味しそうなものが多いんだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "すごかろー！？　ばってん、長崎のいいとこは\r\n食べ物だけじゃなか。温泉なんかもばりよかよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……恋鐘の話を聞いてたら\r\n実際に行きたくなってくるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おお！　きてきて！　\r\n絶対きて欲しいばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんで、プロデューサーにはいつか……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちの実家にもきてほしかね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020150"
  },
  {
    "select": "仕事で行くかもしれない",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "楽しい家なんだろうな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "どうせなら\r\n事務所のみんなと",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はまだその予定はないけど\r\n長崎に行くこともあるだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そしたらうちの出番たい！\r\n長崎の案内で、うちの右に出るもんはおらんけん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そのときはよろしく",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "まかせとって！　一緒にどこ行こうかね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "近くの海もキレイやし、温泉もあるし……\r\nあとは、夜景もはずせんね～",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……表情を見てるだけで\r\nいいところなのが伝わってくるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ……そうかねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（恋鐘の案内で回る長崎か……楽しそうだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020200,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん、最高よ！\r\nうちは家族んことばーり好いとーけん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "港のみんなも好いとーし\r\n長崎の人はみーんなよか人ばい",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘がそれほど言うなら、本当にそうなんだろう\r\n……長崎っていいところなんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふー♪　うちん故郷やけん、当たり前ばい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あーあ、早く家にプロデューサーば連れて行きたか～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってん、実家に帰る前に……\r\nここで、アイドルとして成功せんばいかんけどね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そやから、プロデューサー\r\nもっとばりばりお仕事もってきてくれんね！　よろしく！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020250"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "事務所のみんながユニットを超えて\r\nもっと親睦を深めれるだろうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よかね～、みんなと一緒ならばり楽しそうたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんときはうちがあっちこっち連れて行っちゃるけん\r\nきっと、楽しすぎて時間ば忘れるっちゃねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003020280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そやけん、みんな東京に帰って来とうのうなるばい！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400302/2004003020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、それは困るな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（でも恋鐘に案内してもらったら\r\n本当にそうなりそうだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]